    backlog:hasScoreRationale "Highest user-business value in the register: this is what makes everything already recorded legible to someone who is not reading Turtle. Job size small because every view is derived from facts the register already holds." ;
    backlog:hasBasisKind backlog:Basis_Judged .
fw:E_Views a backlog:CostEstimate ;
