    backlog:hasRationale "A new generation built on a complete product: PBI-versus-task, flow, cost dimensions, human in and on the loop. Project scale, and the kind of work most often called maintenance because it touched something that already existed." .

fw:Init_Plan a backlog:Initiative ;
